EXPERIMENT 1 – Installation of Windows / Kali Linux Operating 
System
Aim: To install an Operating System (Windows / Kali Linux) on a computer using bootable installation media 
and verify its successful operation.
No runnable code — installation steps only.
Windows Installation Verification Commands
winver
systeminfo
hostname
ipconfig
Kali Linux Verification Commands
uname -a
cat /etc/os-release
whoami
hostname
lscpu
df -h
Result: The operating system was successfully installed and verified using system commands.
